    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the\u00a0<i><strong>ultimate test of luck and survival </strong></i>with <strong>One Tap Roulette</strong>, the Russian roulette game where every shot counts - <strong><i>for real</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your colleagues by inviting them on Steam, or face off daring strangers in intense duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The rules?</u></strong> Simple but ruthless: <i>one</i> bullet, <i>one</i> chance, <i>one</i> survivor. Finish each duel to collect points, climb the leaderboard and claim your place at the top. But beware: <strong><u>one defeat and you're out - for good</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong><u>only one life per competitor</u></strong>, the stakes couldn't be higher, and every blow could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you've got what it takes? Take up the challenge and show PRT Ltd. what you're made of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Will you try your luck?</u></i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in the\u00a0<i><strong>ultimate test of luck and survival </strong></i>with <strong>One Tap Roulette</strong>, the Russian roulette game where every shot counts - <strong><i>for real</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your colleagues by inviting them on Steam, or face off daring strangers in intense duels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The rules?</u></strong> Simple but ruthless: <i>one</i> bullet, <i>one</i> chance, <i>one</i> survivor. Finish each duel to collect points, climb the leaderboard and claim your place at the top. But beware: <strong><u>one defeat and you're out - for good</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong><u>only one life per competitor</u></strong>, the stakes couldn't be higher, and every blow could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you've got what it takes? Take up the challenge and show PRT Ltd. what you're made of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Will you try your luck?</u></i></strong></p>",
